# Only the C# gameplay scripts are tracked in this repo - everything else
# (Unity's generated caches, imported/third-party art assets, build output)
# is excluded so the repo stays to source code only. docs/ is the one
# exception: it holds the gameplay captures the README embeds, which have to
# live in the repo for the README to render them.

# Ignore everything at the root by default...
/*

# ...except the things we actually want to track.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Scripts/

# Dead code with zero references anywhere in the project (verified by GUID/class-name
# search and a clean play-mode run) - kept on disk, just not tracked.
/Assets/Scripts/Data/EquipmentOptionTable.cs
/Assets/Scripts/Data/EquipmentOptionTable.cs.meta

# Bird monster roster is wired up (prefabs/defs/animator all reference each other) but
# never actually spawned: MonsterSpawner's stage2*Definition slots are fileID:0 in the
# only scene in the build, so every stage falls back to the stage-1 Footman roster.
# Kept on disk, just not tracked.
/Assets/Scripts/Combat/BirdWaddle.cs
/Assets/Scripts/Combat/BirdWaddle.cs.meta
